      <method name="render_texture" c:identifier="gsk_renderer_render_texture">
        <doc xml:space="preserve" filename="gsk/gskrenderer.c" line="373">
          Renders a scene graph, described by a tree of `GskRenderNode` instances,
to a texture.

The renderer will acquire a reference on the `GskRenderNode` tree while
the rendering is in progress.

If you want to apply any transformations to @root, you should put it into a
transform node and pass that node instead.
        </doc>
        <return-value transfer-ownership="full">
          <type name="Gdk.Texture" c:type="GdkTexture*"/>
        </return-value>
        <parameters>
